      "side": 1,
      "message": "Define \"upstream\". If you mean AOSP then, yes, we should enable the module there.\n\nThis is just a config change, though, so mainline Linux wouldn\u0027t need it. The code is all in mainline:\n```\n$ git grep \"config GOOGLE_MEMCONSOLE_COREBOOT\\|config GOOGLE_COREBOOT_TABLE\\|config GOOGLE_FIRMWARE\" linux/master \nlinux/master:drivers/firmware/google/Kconfig:menuconfig GOOGLE_FIRMWARE\nlinux/master:drivers/firmware/google/Kconfig:config GOOGLE_COREBOOT_TABLE\nlinux/master:drivers/firmware/google/Kconfig:config GOOGLE_MEMCONSOLE_COREBOOT\n```",
      "parentUuid": "3ad1c4e0_df44183d",
